      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having a cache is fine, but if it\u0027s just a cache, the method could just return the stack as if it had been created ; that would make `invokeEnterMethods()` a lot easier to understand because it would not depend on the contents of a member being initalized beforehand.\n\nOf course if you implement my suggestion above you don\u0027t need this at all",
